  m_text: 'Use Case: Defensive Unit reinforcement;


    Description: The defense encampment summons units to asist in defensive battles.
    These units scale with the level of the owning empire''s leader.


    Notes:

    - The amount of reinforcement units summoned will depend on how large the attacking
    force is.

    - The defense encampment will only activate when an army or village is attacked.

    - Surviving units summoned by the defense encampment will be returned to the camp
    at the end of battle.'
