  m_text: "Use Case: Cheap resource generation; Resource purchasing and sale;\n\nDescription:
    The work camp is an important tool to boost resoruce generation or convert resource
    into gold.\n\nNotes:\n- Regardless of how many resources were purchased on the
    previous turn, the work camp will regenerate all missing reosurce. Resoruces generated
    per turn do not stack. \n- Resources are bought and sold at the same price.\n-
    The work camp generates its own gold every turn, this generated gold is used when
    selling resources and has no cap."
