  m_text: 'Operation blocks, or OpBlocks, are the logic of the entire system.

    OpBlocks hold the conditions set by the user. At least one OpBlock needs to be
    filled for conditions to work.

    When there is more than one OpBlock, a logical operator option will appear, allowing
    conditions to be linked. These logical operators will execute from the top down
    and will only apply to the block beneath it.'
