    m_TypeName: UnityEngine.UI.MaskableGraphic+CullStateChangedEvent, UnityEngine.UI,
      Version=1.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
  m_text: 'Use Case: Unit durability enhancement;


    Description: The Barrier tower provides units with a variable amount of temporary
    health points to all units at the start of a battle.


    Notes:

    - Unlike the mending and empower buffs, the barrier provided by the tower will
    only expire at the end of battle or when broken by damage.

    - Use the confermation toggle to prevent the long downtime from being used on
    weak battles .

    - Barrier blocks weapon damage and spell damage, but not digestion or status effect
    damage (such as poison).'
