      Version=1.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
  m_text: "\r\n\r\nCODE:\r\nOriginal game by <b>darkevilme/WarpedRealities</b>\r\nConverting
    the game to Unity / C# and all the new features - <b>Aurilika</b>\r\n<i>None of
    us would be here if not for the amazing work by these two!\r\nGive your Cat/Dog
    units many pets and please feed your Auri!</i>\r\n\r\n<u>Additional testing /
    bug fixing / coding by</u>\r\n<b>Selicia</b>\r\n<b>Cattitude</b>\r\n<b>Scarabyte</b>\r\n<b>Sheights</b>\r\n<b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\n<b>Wolfwar106</b>\r\n<b>Ignis
    Flamescale</b>\r\n\r\nCrux Race code by <b>ChemicalCrux</b>\r\nFeralLions setup,
    name pool and behavior by <b>Cattitude</b>.\r\nAlso implemented farts and added
    the belly rub hand, traits, fixes and other additions to the code base.\r\nAnimated
    bellies, death skull and tactical chat long improvements - <b>Baif</b>\r\nAsymmetrical
    Breast Vore by <b>GreenSlime</b>\r\nAnimated Breasts by <b>Ignis Flamescale</b>,
    borrowing and repurposing code from the bellies\r\nAlt vore code mostly by <b>KuroTenko</b>
    (breast vore, unbirth and cockvore)\r\nScat V2 by <b>dddddd2</b>\r\nMulti-race
    villages code by <b>Danthebur</b>\r\nMaw/Gatemaw alternate destinations by <b>Cattitude</b>\r\nInfiltrators
    functionality by <b>Cattitude</b>\r\nGrowth Trait functionality by <b>Cattitude</b>\r\nAssimilation
    Trait functionality by <b>Cattitude</b>\r\nExtraction Functionality by <b>Cattitude</b>\r\nRandom
    Traits system implemented by <b>Cattitude</b>\r\nOptions/Content menus makeover
    by <b>Scarabyte</b>\r\nDay/Night cycle by <b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\nMetamorphosis
    functionality by <b>KuroTenko</b>\r\nLizards AV/UB implementation by <b>Ignis
    Flamescale</b>\r\nSpecial thanks to <b>Sheights</b> for fixing the errors that
    the above caused\r\nCondoms for CV disposal implemented by <b>Ignis Flamescale</b>\r\nClean
    Disposal (Diapers) implemented by <b>Wolfwar106</b>\r\nClean Disposal (Diapers)
    log messages by <b>Mocha</b>\r\nGoddess' Mercy implemented by <b>Wolfwar106</b>\r\nScout
    Armies implemented by <b>Wolfwar106</b>\r\nKiss transfer implemented by <b>Wolfwar106</b>\r\nBladder
    vore implemented by <b>Wolfwar106</b>\r\nNearbyEnemies variable functionality
    by <b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\nUnit Upkeep code by <b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\nUnit Deploy
    Cost code by <b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\nThe incredibly expansive Construction System
    code by <b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\nAncient Teleporters by <b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\nCustom/Conditional/Tagged
    Trait system by <b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\nPotions by <b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\nUnit/Trait
    Tag system by <b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\nSize-based damage system by <b>CaneSugarCat</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>AUDIO:</b>\r\nAlmost
    all of the digestion sounds are from <b>chemicalcrux</b>\r\nAdditional Vore sound
    effects recorded by <b>Ignis Flamescale</b>\r\nAdditional Sound effects obtained
    from <b>https://www.zapsplat.com</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>WRITERS:</b>\r\nA significant
    amount of log messages by <b>Katar</b>\r\nA good percentage of the town names
    are by <b>Katar</b>\r\nA significant amount of log messages by <b>HarryS</b>\r\nMost
    of the scat tactical log text from <b>InfernoTheDragon</b> or <b>Cattitude</b>\r\nAdditional
    scat log messages by <b>Ignis Flamescale</b>\r\nPouch vore, Tail vore, Cleavage
    vore, 95% Bladder vore, and Condom disposal messages by <b>Tatltuae</b>\r\nFart
    log messages by <b>Cattitude</b>\r\nWide array of synonyms applied throughout
    the TacLog by <b>Ignis Flamescale</b>\r\nDeer Log messages by <b>@bane of Fun#6036</b>\r\nA
    good amount of the unique race names and descriptions by <b>Tatltuae</b>\r\nAdditional
    Force feeding, Rebirth/Conversion, Regurgitation, Kiss transfer, and Vore steal
    log messages by <b>Tatltuae</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>ARTISTS:</b>\r\n\r\n<b><u>AgentAmbi:</b></u>\r\nBella\r\n\r\n<b><u>CaneSugarCat:</b></u>\r\nWood,Earth,River,
    and Fungal Dryad\r\nFeral Slime\r\nJackal\r\nMainland Elves\r\nMice\r\nOoviKat\r\nPudding\r\nSalix\r\nVolcanic
    Tileset\r\n\r\n<b><u>Cattitude:</b></u>\r\nFeral Lions\r\n\r\n<b><u>dddddd2:</b></u>\r\nScat
    V2\r\n\r\n<b><u>GreenSlime:</b></u>\r\nCats\r\nDogs\r\nWolves\r\nFoxes\r\nBunnies\r\nHumans\r\nand
    their update \r\n(w/ <b>Micadi</b>)\r\nAsura\r\nAuri\r\nCentaur\r\nCrypters \r\nDragons\r\nEquines\r\nErin\r\nFairies\r\nFeral
    Wolves\r\nHarpies\r\nImps\r\nKobolds\r\nLamia\r\nLizards\r\nPanthers\r\nPuca\r\nScylla\r\nSelicia\r\nSlimes\r\nSuccubus\r\nTaurus\r\nTigers\r\nVagrants\r\nZera\r\nZoey\r\n\r\n<b><u>HarryS:</b></u>\r\nAlligators\r\nAlternate
    furry genitals\r\nBanner designs\r\nCake\r\nCatfish\r\nCollectors\r\nCompys\r\nCrux\r\nDark
    Swallowers\r\nDratopyr\r\nEastern Dragons\r\nFeral Bats\r\nFeral Sharks\r\nHarvesters\r\nKangaroo\r\nRaptors\r\nSchiwardez\r\nSerpents\r\nVoilin\r\nWyvern\r\nWyvern
    Matrons\r\n\r\n<u><b>Ignis Flamescale</b></u>\r\nLizard outfits\r\nLizard UB/AV
    pose\r\nSergals\r\n\r\n<b><u>Inferno The Dragon:</b></u>\r\nFeral Orcas\r\n\r\n<b><u>Komaru:</b></u>\r\nScat
    sprites\r\n\r\n<b><u>KuroTenko:</b></u>\r\nWhisp\r\nYouko\r\n\r\n<b><u>Magentasaur:</b></u>\r\nD.R.A.C.O.\r\nScorch\r\nVision\r\n\r\n<b><u>Micadi:</b></u>\r\nAlraune\r\nAnts\r\nWarrior
    Ants\r\nAvians\r\nBadgers\r\nBees\r\nCockatrice\r\nDeer\r\nDemi Bats\r\nDemi Dragons\r\nDriders\r\nEarthworms\r\nFeral
    Foxes\r\nFeral Lizards\r\nFeit\r\nFrogs\r\nGazelle\r\nGnolls\r\nGryphons\r\nHippos\r\nKomodos\r\nKonane\r\nLupine\r\nMantis\r\nMerfolk\r\nMonitors\r\nRaiju\r\nRenamon\r\nRyan\r\nSharks\r\nSingularity\r\nSkapa\r\nSlugs\r\nSmudger\r\nSpaceRoach\r\nTaraluxia\r\nTerminids\r\nTerrorbirds\r\nT-Rex\r\nUtahraptors\r\nVargul\r\nVipers\r\nYordel\r\n\r\n<b><u>Novoyetelo:</b></u>\r\nAbakhanskya\r\nCierihaka\r\n\r\n<b><u>NemoTheAxolotl:</b></u>\r\nCherub\r\nSoul
    Sprites\r\nSeraph\r\n\r\n<b><u>Operation Omneon:</b></u>\r\n<i>Tatltuae</i>\r\nEevee\r\nUmbreon\r\nEqualeon\r\nFeral
    Eevee\r\nFeral Umbreon\r\nFeral Equaleon \r\n\r\n<b><u>PotatoFarmer:</b></u>\r\nDew
    Sprites\r\nFeral Frogs\r\n\r\n<b><u>Sheights:</b></u>\r\nGoodra\r\n\r\n<b><u>Supra:</b></u>\r\nOlivia\r\n\r\n<b><u>Tatltuae:</b></u>\r\nAabayx\r\nBanner
    updates (w/ Wolfwar)\r\nBird scat sprites\r\nIliijiith\r\nSchiwardez OV Belly
    sprites\r\nTatltuae\r\nTwisted Vine Updates\r\nUrine sprites\r\nVirae Ultimae\r\n\r\n<b><u>Wolfwar106:</b></u>\r\nBoom
    Bunnies\r\nDiaper sprites\r\nHamsters\r\nPlate Armor\r\nRWU Mercenary Corp\r\nXelhilde\r\nSword
    alt sprites for maces on \"default races\"\r\n\r\n<b><u>Yonell:</b></u>\r\nBears\r\nViisels\r\nSeville\r\n\r\n\r\n[Old
    Graphics (now removed, but they helped guide the early stages, and were inspirations
    for their replacements):\r\n[Base character sprites (Base model / cat /dog) by
    <b>Rayen</b> (I modified them to a higher resolution, and added the foxes wolves
    and bunnies.)\r\nImps / Lamia / Clothing sprites / Fox tail / The high quality
    village sprites by <b>GreenSlime</b>\r\nLizard sprites, Crypters sprites, base
    model fur patches by <b>failbird105</b>\r\nSlime sprites and the very large breast/cock
    sizes by <b>Turbotowns</b>\r\nScylla sprites by <b>LLEPAICG</b>\r\nHarpysprites
    by <b>Kligor</b>\r\nAlternate breast sizes by <b>KuroTenko</b>\r\nEquine sprites
    by <b>Anonymouse_Equine</b>]\r\nSome of the remaining sprites are still by <b>darkevilme</b>,
    but most of the tactical and strategic ground tiles are adapted from cc0 files.]\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>CHARACTER
    RIGHTS:</b>\r\n<i>These are all OCs and as such we must respect their wishes.\r\nThese
    characters can <b>not</b> be used outside of this game \r\nwithout explicit permission
    from their owners.</i>\r\n\r\n<b><u>Selicia:</b></u>\r\nSelicia\r\nZera\r\n\r\n<b><u>InfernoTheDragon:</b></u>\r\nZoey\r\nFeit\r\nTaraluxia\r\nKonane\r\n\r\n<b><u>Magentasaur:</b></u>\r\nScorch\r\nVision\r\nD.R.A.C.O.\r\n\r\n<b><u>SecretlyKoishi:</b></u>\r\nErin\r\n\r\n<b><u>GreenSlime:</b></u>\r\nAsura\r\n\r\n<b><u>Aurilika:</b></u>\r\nAuri\r\n\r\n<b><u>Novoyetelo:</b></u>\r\nAbakhanskya\r\nCierihaka(?)\r\n\r\n<b><u>StarSpectre:</b></u>\r\nSingularity\r\n\r\n<b><u>CaneSugarCat:</b></u>\r\nSalix\r\n\r\n<b><u>Tatltuae:</b></u>\r\nTatltuae\r\n\r\n<b><u>Wolfwar106:</b></u>\r\nXelhilde\r\n\r\n<b><u>Supra:</b></u>\r\nOlivia\r\n\r\n<b><u>Legoshi/RyanTheSergal:</b></u>\r\nRyan\r\n\r\n<b><u>Zezmeril:</b></u>\r\nSkapa\r\n\r\n<b><u>IronGelatin:</b></u>\r\nNectar\r\n\r\n<b><u>Yonell:</b></u>\r\nSeville\r\n\r\n<b><u>NemoTheAxolotl:</b></u>\r\nCherub\r\nSeraph\r\n\r\n<b><u>Bandi
    Namco/Toei Animation:</b></u>\r\nRenamon\r\n\r\n<b><u>GAME FREAK/Creatures Inc./Nintendo:</b></u>\r\nGoodra\r\nEevee,
    Anthro and Feral\r\nUmbreon, Anthro and Feral\r\n(Feels weird, I know.  But credit
    where its due.)\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><u><i>Note from Ignis</b></u></i> \r\nI know I'm
    missing a bunch of stuff \r\nas this game is seven years old now and I can \r\nonly
    recall so much information on my own.\r\nI'm especially unclear on who wrote what
    log messages\r\nOr who wrote the events for that matter.\r\nIf you see anything
    missing that you would \r\nlike added, please don't hesitate to contact \r\nme
    and let me know!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"
