  m_text: 'Use Case: Offense and Defense spell casting;


    Description: The Caster tower casts a set amount of spells at the start of combat.


    Notes:

    - Targets are selected at random.

    - Spells are casted in the order of basic spells -> buff spells -> advanced spells,
    should the tower run out of mana charges.

    - Set all sliders to zero to stop the tower from casting, allowing mana to regenerate
    if need be.'
