  m_text: 'Use Case: Resource generation;


    Description: The Lumber Site uses workers to generate wood, Natural Materials,
    and Prefabs at a consistent rate.


    Notes:

    - Any unassigned workers will be set to generate wood.

    - Not every resource needs to be generated at the same time, a specific one can
    be focused.

    - Generating a prefab takes double the workers as generating wood or natural materials'
