    m_TypeName: UnityEngine.UI.MaskableGraphic+CullStateChangedEvent, UnityEngine.UI,
      Version=1.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
  m_text: 'Select type, then click to place, space to deselect. You can also right
    click on the map to select the tile type of that location.  Camera will only drag
    if no type is selected. To remove villages, replace their terrain with any type.  Village
    max pop is based on surrounding farms.


    Editing Active Maps:

    If you place a village of the same race on a friendly village it will refill the
    population to max, if you place a village of a different race, it will convert
    the current owner to that race.

    Any armies with water under them will drown when the map editor is exited. '
