  m_text: "Use Case: Village Creation; \n\nDescription: The town hall is the start
    of a new village. Upon completion of one if it's upgrades, it will become a village.\n\nNotes:\n-
    Tiles such as hills and trees will also be converted to farm tiles.\n- Tiles such
    as water will not be converted to a farm tile.\n- Only one upgrade is needed,
    purchasing multiple will only extend the time.\n- Town Hall will become a village
    on it's first turn active, if uninterupted, this occurs the turn after it completes
    it's upgrade."
